<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'About Us | LifeLine' }) %>
<div class="about-page">
  <section class="wrap about-intro" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="about-intro-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT LIFELINE</span>
      <h1 id="about-title">Bringing care closer, <span>one connection at a time.</span></h1>
      <p>LifeLine is a Blood Bank &amp; Donor Management System that helps people find donor and blood bank information, register as donors, and coordinate blood requests in their community.</p>
      <div class="about-intro-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/donor/register">Become a Donor <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="button about-button-outline" href="/donors">Find a Donor <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="about-intro-photo">
      <img src="/images/about-care.jpg" alt="A healthcare professional talking with a patient" decoding="async">
      <figcaption><span aria-hidden="true">♥</span> Give. Connect. Care.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-overview about-section" aria-labelledby="about-overview-title">
    <div class="about-overview-photo">
      <img src="/images/donor-network.jpg" alt="A healthcare professional ready to support community health" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
    <div class="about-overview-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">A COMMUNITY-FOCUSED PLATFORM</span>
      <h2 id="about-overview-title">About LifeLine</h2>
      <p>Finding the right information during a blood need can feel overwhelming. LifeLine brings donor discovery, donor registration, blood bank details, and request coordination together in one place.</p>
      <p>Our platform supports connections between community members and local services. It does not replace a blood bank, clinical assessment, or professional medical advice.</p>
      <a class="about-text-link" href="/how-it-works">See how LifeLine works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-purpose about-section" aria-labelledby="about-purpose-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="about-section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">WHY WE ARE HERE</span>
        <h2 id="about-purpose-title">Our mission &amp; vision</h2>
        <p>Awareness and connection can help communities respond with care.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-purpose-grid">
        <article class="about-purpose-card">
          <span class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">♥</span>
          <h3>Our mission</h3>
          <p>Encourage voluntary blood donation and make it easier for people to find local donor and blood bank information when they need it.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="about-purpose-card">
          <span class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
          <h3>Our vision</h3>
          <p>A connected, compassionate community where donors, people seeking blood, and care services can coordinate with clarity.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-section" aria-labelledby="about-features-title">
    <div class="about-section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">MADE FOR COMMUNITY CONNECTION</span>
      <h2 id="about-features-title">Why choose LifeLine?</h2>
      <p>Useful tools help make donor and blood bank coordination easier to navigate.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-feature-grid">
      <article class="about-feature-card"><span class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><h3>Search donors</h3><p>Explore donor listings by blood group and location.</p><a href="/donors" aria-label="Search donors">Find donors <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="about-feature-card"><span class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span><h3>Coordinate urgent requests</h3><p>Use emergency matching and blood request tools to help coordinate a need.</p><a href="/emergency-match" aria-label="Open emergency donor match">Emergency match <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="about-feature-card"><span class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">＋</span><h3>Find blood bank information</h3><p>View listed blood bank information and contact details.</p><a href="/blood-banks" aria-label="View blood banks">View blood banks <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="about-feature-card"><span class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><h3>Register as a donor</h3><p>Share your donor details and availability with the community.</p><a href="/donor/register" aria-label="Register as a donor">Donor registration <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="about-feature-card"><span class="about-icon" aria-hidden="true">▤</span><h3>Manage requests</h3><p>Submit and follow blood requests through your LifeLine account.</p><a href="/request-blood" aria-label="Create a blood request">Request blood <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-section" aria-labelledby="about-process-title">
    <div class="about-section-heading">
      <span class="eyebrow">A CLEARER WAY TO CONNECT</span>
      <h2 id="about-process-title">How our platform works</h2>
      <p>LifeLine supports the coordination journey; medical decisions stay with qualified professionals.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="about-process-grid">
      <li><span class="about-process-number">01</span><h3>Register</h3><p>Donors create an account and share their donor details and availability.</p></li>
      <li><span class="about-process-number">02</span><h3>Search</h3><p>People can browse donor listings by blood group and location, or view blood bank information.</p></li>
      <li><span class="about-process-number">03</span><h3>Submit a request</h3><p>Request blood through the platform and provide the information needed for coordination.</p></li>
      <li><span class="about-process-number">04</span><h3>Connect with care</h3><p>Use the listed contact and request information to follow up with donors or services.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="about-audience about-section" aria-labelledby="about-audience-title">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="about-section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">A PLACE FOR EVERY HELPER</span>
        <h2 id="about-audience-title">Who can use LifeLine?</h2>
        <p>Anyone involved in community blood donation coordination can use the platform's relevant tools.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-audience-grid">
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">♥</span><h3>Donors</h3><p>Register and share availability.</p></article>
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">＋</span><h3>Recipients &amp; families</h3><p>Search listings and submit requests.</p></article>
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">✚</span><h3>Hospitals</h3><p>Use the platform to find listed blood bank and donor information.</p></article>
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><h3>Blood banks</h3><p>Connect community members with listed service information.</p></article>
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><h3>Volunteers</h3><p>Help share donation awareness and support coordination.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-community about-section" aria-labelledby="about-community-title">
    <figure class="about-community-photo">
      <img src="/images/community-donation.jpg" alt="A volunteer donating blood at a collection center" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </figure>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">OUR COMMUNITY IMPACT</span>
      <h2 id="about-community-title">Every willing donor strengthens a circle of support.</h2>
      <p>Voluntary blood donation is an important way people can contribute to community care. LifeLine helps make awareness, donor discovery, and coordination more accessible—one connection at a time.</p>
      <p>Donation availability, eligibility, and transfusion decisions must always be confirmed by authorized services and qualified medical professionals.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-cta" aria-labelledby="about-cta-title">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">CARE STARTS WITH CONNECTION</span><h2 id="about-cta-title">Be part of the LifeLine community.</h2><p>Register as a donor or look for donor information in your area.</p></div>
    <div class="about-cta-actions">
      <a class="button button-light" href="/donor/register">Become a Donor <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="button about-cta-secondary" href="/donors">Find a Donor <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <p class="wrap about-medical-note"><strong>Our role:</strong> LifeLine supports coordination only. Blood donation eligibility, clinical screening, and transfusion decisions belong to qualified medical professionals.</p>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
